disabled=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"xl:hidden p-1.5 text-[#62666F] hover:text-[#111217] transition-colors\" aria-label=\"Toggle menu\" aria-controls=\"mobile-navigation\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu h-5 w-5\"><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></div></div></header><!--astro:end--></astro-island><main id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"flex-1 mx-auto max-w-[1440px] w-full px-4 sm:px-6 py-10\"><header class=\"max-w-3xl mb-9\"><p class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--tess-ink-secondary)] mb-3\">Open interface commons</p><h1 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-4\">Page architectures</h1><p class=\"text-[var(--tess-ink-secondary)] leading-relaxed\">Thirty-six page recipes describe real interface jobs. Each recipe shows its required roles and starts a brief in Compose, where the validated Gold registry supplies runtime resources.</p></header><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><article class=\"border border-[var(--tess-hairline)] p-6\"><p class=\"font-mono text-xs mb-3\">marketing · marketing</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-3\">Marketing Home</h2><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4\">Flagship product landing page with value proposition hero, social proof, interactive proof demo, and conversion CTA.</p><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-sm mb-2\">Required roles</h3><ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 text-sm mb-5\"><li>navigation</li><li>hero</li><li>value-proposition</li><li>conversion-cta</li><li>footer</li></ul><a class=\"text-[var(--tess-cobalt)] underline\" href=\"/compose?brief=Build%20a%20Marketing%20Home.%20Flagship%20product%20landing%20page%20with%20value%20proposition%20hero%2C%20social%20proof%2C%20interactive%20proof%20demo%2C%20and%20conversion%20CTA.\">Compose this architecture →</a></article><article class=\"border border-[var(--tess-hairline)] p-6\"><p class=\"font-mono text-xs mb-3\">marketing · marketing</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-3\">Product Overview</h2><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4\">Detailed platform capability overview showcasing architecture, technical workflows, and engine internals.</p><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-sm mb-2\">Required roles</h3><ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 text-sm mb-5\"><li>hero</li><li>feature-grid</li><li>technical-specs</li><li>footer</li></ul><a class=\"text-[var(--tess-cobalt)] underline\" href=\"/compose?brief=Build%20a%20Product%20Overview.%20Detailed%20platform%20capability%20overview%20showcasing%20architecture%2C%20technical%20workflows%2C%20and%20engine%20internals.\">Compose this architecture →</a></article><article class=\"border border-[var(--tess-hairline)] p-6\"><p class=\"font-mono text-xs mb-3\">marketing · marketing</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-3\">Use Case Landing</h2><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4\">Targeted persona solution page articulating problem-solution dynamics, architecture blueprints, and ROI proof.</p><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-sm mb-2\">Required roles</h3><ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 text-sm mb-5\"><li>hero</li><li>problem-solution</li><li>workflow-steps</li><li>conversion-cta</li></ul><a class=\"text-[var(--tess-cobalt)] underline\" href=\"/compose?brief=Build%20a%20Use%20Case%20Landing.%20Targeted%20persona%20solution%20page%20articulating%20problem-solution%20dynamics%2C%20architecture%20blueprints%2C%20and%20ROI%20proof.\">Compose this architecture →</a></article><article class=\"border border-[var(--tess-hairline)] p-6\"><p class=\"font-mono text-xs mb-3\">marketing · marketing</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-3\">Industry Landing</h2><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4\">Vertical sector landing highlighting regulatory compliance, security audits, and enterprise customer testimonials.</p><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-sm mb-2\">Required roles</h3><ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 text-sm mb-5\"><li>hero</li><li>compliance-badges</li><li>case-studies</li><li>conversion-cta</li></ul><a class=\"text-[var(--tess-cobalt)] underline\" href=\"/compose?brief=Build%20a%20Industry%20Landing.%20Vertical%20sector%20landing%20highlighting%20regulatory%20compliance%2C%20security%20audits%2C%20and%20enterprise%20customer%20testimonials.\">Compose this architecture →</a></article><article class=\"border border-[var(--tess-hairline)] p-6\"><p class=\"font-mono text-xs mb-3\">marketing · marketing</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-3\">Pricing</h2><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4\">Transparent tier comparison with monthly/annual billing toggle, feature matrix, and enterprise contact card.</p><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-sm mb-2\">Required roles</h3><ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 text-sm mb-5\"><li>hero</li><li>pricing-matrix</li><li>faq-accordion</li><li>guarantee-callout</li></ul><a class=\"text-[var(--tess-cobalt)] underline\" href=\"/compose?brief=Build%20a%20Pricing.%20Transparent%20tier%20comparison%20with%20monthly%2Fannual%20billing%20toggle%2C%20feature%20matrix%2C%20and%20enterprise%20contact%20card.\">Compose this architecture →</a></article><article class=\"border border-[var(--tess-hairline)] p-6\"><p class=\"font-mono text-xs mb-3\">marketing · marketing</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-3\">Security &amp; Trust</h2><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4\">Enterprise assurance dossier outlining SOC2 compliance, data encryption boundaries, and incident response SLAs.</p><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-sm mb-2\">Required roles</h3><ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 text-sm mb-5\"><li>hero</li><li>security-certifications</li><li>compliance-matrix</li><li>sla-guarantee</li></ul><a class=\"text-[var(--tess-cobalt)] underline\" href=\"/compose?brief=Build%20