-[var(--tess-hairline)] p-6\"><p class=\"font-mono text-xs mb-3\">app · index-list</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-3\">Tasks &amp; Approvals</h2><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4\">Multi-party governance queue displaying pending approval requests, diff comparisons, and signoff actions.</p><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-sm mb-2\">Required roles</h3><ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 text-sm mb-5\"><li>approval-queue</li><li>diff-viewer</li><li>action-controls</li></ul><a class=\"text-[var(--tess-cobalt)] underline\" href=\"/compose?brief=Build%20a%20Tasks%20%26%20Approvals.%20Multi-party%20governance%20queue%20displaying%20pending%20approval%20requests%2C%20diff%20comparisons%2C%20and%20signoff%20actions.\">Compose this architecture →</a></article><article class=\"border border-[var(--tess-hairline)] p-6\"><p class=\"font-mono text-xs mb-3\">app · workspace-editor</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-3\">Calendar/Schedule</h2><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4\">Resource allocation schedule with timeline gantt, shift bookings, and availability slot pickers.</p><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-sm mb-2\">Required roles</h3><ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 text-sm mb-5\"><li>date-picker</li><li>calendar-grid</li><li>sidebar-details</li></ul><a class=\"text-[var(--tess-cobalt)] underline\" href=\"/compose?brief=Build%20a%20Calendar%2FSchedule.%20Resource%20allocation%20schedule%20with%20timeline%20gantt%2C%20shift%20bookings%2C%20and%20availability%20slot%20pickers.\">Compose this architecture →</a></article><article class=\"border border-[var(--tess-hairline)] p-6\"><p class=\"font-mono text-xs mb-3\">app · index-list</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-3\">Team Directory</h2><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4\">Organization personnel directory with department filters, reporting hierarchy, and member cards.</p><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-sm mb-2\">Required roles</h3><ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 text-sm mb-5\"><li>filter-bar</li><li>member-grid</li></ul><