s=\"text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4\">Role-based access control matrix with member invitation drawer, custom role builder, and permission switches.</p><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-sm mb-2\">Required roles</h3><ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 text-sm mb-5\"><li>invite-drawer</li><li>members-table</li><li>role-matrix</li></ul><a class=\"text-[var(--tess-cobalt)] underline\" href=\"/compose?brief=Build%20a%20Team%20%26%20Permissions.%20Role-based%20access%20control%20matrix%20with%20member%20invitation%20drawer%2C%20custom%20role%20builder%2C%20and%20permission%20switches.\">Compose this architecture →</a></article><article class=\"border border-[var(--tess-hairline)] p-6\"><p class=\"font-mono text-xs mb-3\">settings · billing-account</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-3\">Billing &amp; Usage</h2><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4\">Subscription entitlement management with live compute usage meters, payment card editor, and invoice downloads.</p><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-sm mb-2\">Required roles</h3><ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 text-sm mb-5\"><li>plan-card</li><li>usage-meter</li><li>invoices-table</li></ul><a class=\"text-[var(--tess-cobalt)] underline\" href=\"/compose?brief=Build%20a%20Billing%20%26%20Usage.%20Subscription%20entitlement%20management%20with%20live%20compute%20usage%20meters%2C%20payment%20card%20editor%2C%20and%20invoice%20downloads.\">Compose this architecture →</a></article><article class=\"border border-[var(--tess-hairline)] p-6\"><p class=\"font-mono text-xs mb-3\">settings · settings</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-3\">API &amp; Integrations</h2><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4\">Third-party webhook endpoints, OAuth connection tokens, and secret API key creation controls.</p><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-sm mb-2\">Required roles</h3><ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 text-sm mb-5\"><li>keys-table</li><li>webhooks-list</li><li>connected-apps-grid</li></ul><a class=\"text-[var(--tess-cobalt)] underline\" href=\"/compose?brief=Build%20a%20API%20%26%20Integrations.%20Third-party%20webhook%20endpoints%2C%20OAuth%20connection%20tokens%2C%20and%20secret%20API%20key%20creation%20controls.\">Compose this architecture →</a></article><article class=\"border border-[var(--tess-hairline)] p-6\"><p class=\"font-mono text-xs mb-3\">settings · admin</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-3\">Admin Console</h2><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4\">Superuser management panel with tenant switcher, live audit trail log stream, and feature flag toggles.</p><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-sm mb-2\">Required roles</h3><ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 text-sm mb-5\"><li>tenant-switcher</li><li>audit-stream</li><li>feature-flags</li></ul><a class=\"text-[var(--tess-cobalt)] underline\" href=\"/compose?brief=Build%20a%20Admin%20Console.%20Superuser%20management%20panel%20with%20tenant%20switcher%2C%20live%20audit%20trail%20log%20stream%2C%20and%20feature%20flag%20toggles.\">Compose this architecture →</a></article><article class=\"border border-[var(--tess-hairline)] p-6\"><p class=\"font-mono text-xs mb-3\">utility · support</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-3\">Help &amp; Support</h2><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4\">Customer assistance portal with service health indicator, searchable FAQ accordions, and support ticket form.</p><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-sm mb-2\">Required roles</h3><ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 text-sm mb-5\"><li>service-status</li><li>faq-accordion</li><li>ticket-form</li></ul><a class=\"text-[var(--tess-cobalt)] underline\" href=\"/compose?brief=Build%20a%20Help%20%26%20Support.%20Customer%20assistance%20portal%20with%20service%20health%20indicator%2C%20searchable%20FAQ%20accordions%2C%20and%20support%20ticket%20form.\">Compose this architecture →</a></article></div></main><footer class=\"border-t border-[var(--tess-hairline)] px-6 py-8\"><nav aria-label=\"Footer\" class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1440px] flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-sm\"><a href=\"/about\">About</a><a href=\"/docs\">